      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "虚构核查：两次训练运行使用同一组12个测试样本，真类别0有10个、类别1有2个。混淆矩阵行是真类别、列是预测类别；运行1为[[8,2],[0,2]]，运行2为[[2,8],[2,0]]。所有类都按同一规则计算F1，无零分母。原稿明确写“mean of run-wise macro-F1”；另一个分析明确写“macro-F1 from the pooled run-example predictions”，把两矩阵相加。核查者认为只有一种汇总可以合法，要求无条件改为另一种；还有人把24个预测结果写成24个独立采集样本。\n\n请分别计算两次macro-F1、它们的均值、汇总矩阵的macro-F1，以及两种accuracy汇总。判断两种F1能否各自在正确定义下成立，原稿是否应为了数值一致而自动换评价对象；说明独立测试样本数。给两种汇总各一条简短英文结果句，不虚构统计显著性、重复次数或新实验，也不要把正确的pooling一概禁用。\n",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Compute run macro-F1 7/9 and 1/7, mean 29/63, pooled macro-F1 7/16 and both accuracy summaries 1/2.",
        "Preserve either explicitly defined aggregation without changing the approved target; retain 12 unique test samples and 24 prediction records."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Ban a correctly labeled pooled analysis or force both nonlinear summaries to agree.",
        "Treat repeated predictions as newly acquired samples or invent statistical significance."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
